invalid type: string "SECTION 26:\nTEACHER EVALUATION\n(As per HEC and PU QEC guidelines)\nSECTION 27: DEPARTMENTAL EXAMINATION COMMITTEE\n1.\nConstitution of Committee\nEach Department/Centre/Institute/ College/ School shall constitute a Departmental Examination\nCommittee comprising following:\na.\nThe Chairman / Director / Principal of the Department / Institute / Centre / College / School;\nb.